  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3245.12 Display and Replacement of Stickers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3245.12 Display and Replacement of Stickers. In the event an inspection sticker is lost, destroyed, mutilated, or the owner removes it in any manner, the owner shall have the vehicle re-inspected, except as provided in Saf-C 3246.02 for replacement windshields.\n\n#11016, eff 1-6-16 (from Saf-C 3245.10); ss by #12196, eff 10-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3200.html"
